{{Passive skill box|Tranquility}}

'''Tranquility''' is a [[notable passive skill]] that grants increased maximum [[energy shield]] and [[Transfiguration of Soul]].

Transfiguration of Soul causes increases and reductions to Maximum Energy Shield to also affect Spell Damage at 30% of their value.

You can only acquire this passive through Anointment (using [[Oil]]s) on an [[Amulet]] or valid [[Oil#List_of_Blight_uniques|Blight Unique]] item.

